OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and mostly cloudy morning
OL,6,Fbut some bright or sunny intervals
OL,7,Fbreaking through. Cloud thickening in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with the odd spot of
OL,9,Frain possible. Brisk southeasterly
OL,10,Fwinds will be strong at times with
OL,11,Fcoastal gales or severe gales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly dry and cloudy this
OL,14,Fevening, but a band of heavy rain
OL,15,Freaches western coasts around
OL,16,Fmidnight, spreading east overnight.
OL,17,FStrong southeasterly winds bring
OL,18,Fcoastal gales or severe gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
