OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain
OL,6,Fspreading eastwards and clearing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. This leaves a
OL,8,Flargely dry afternoon with long sunny
OL,9,Fspells developing. Breezy with strong
OL,10,Fwinds over Argyll.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FMostly dry with sunny spells Thursday,
OL,14,Fcloudier with rain spreading east in
OL,15,Fthe evening. Mostly cloudy Friday with
OL,16,Frain or showers. Largely dry with
OL,17,Fsunny spells Saturday. Breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
